@enl_protocolo
title: Cómo se corre el hilo
new-page: true
face-image: img/safehouse.jpg

= Cómo se corre el hilo

The proposal is agreed in an hour. The next question takes all night, and it is the one that will actually decide whether any of this kills you: *how does the thing physically work?* Somebody has to carry things between a safe house in Guadalajara and a camp in the sierra de Atoyac, repeatedly, for years, through a country with checkpoints on every road.

Every answer is a different way of being caught.

- @enl_pr_ciego: A single courier who knows nothing — no names, no camp, a dead drop in Atoyac and a walk-up she never sees the end of. *(slow, clumsy, almost unbreakable)*
- @enl_pr_propio: Send one of your own down to live in the city as the permanent link. *(fast and reliable; one of yours in the most dangerous place in Mexico)*
- @enl_pr_suben: They come up to the sierra themselves. Face to face, no intermediaries, total trust. *(the best coordination there is; the city now knows where you sleep)*

@enl_pr_ciego
go-to: foco_eventos.enl_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="ciego"; Q.ch_n1=-14; !}

@enl_pr_propio
go-to: foco_eventos.enl_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="propio"; Q.ch_n1=6; Q.f_hombres-=1; Q.inteligencia=(Q.inteligencia||0)+4; !}

@enl_pr_suben
go-to: foco_eventos.enl_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="suben"; Q.ch_n1=22; Q.f_parque+=6; Q.inteligencia=(Q.inteligencia||0)+4; Q.internac_armada=(Q.internac_armada||0)+1; !}

@enl_fin
new-page: true
face-image: img/lecumberri.jpg
on-arrival: {!
var _riesgo=(Q.ch_n1||0)+(Q.estado_intel||0)*0.4+((Q.ch_p1==="si")?8:0)-((Q.disciplina||65)*0.15)+(Math.random()*24-12);
Q.ch_res=(_riesgo>=20)?"roto":((_riesgo>=6)?"rozado":"aguanta");
if(Q.ch_res==="aguanta"){ Q.f_parque+=10; Q.inteligencia=(Q.inteligencia||0)+4; Q.pol_intl=(Q.pol_intl||0)+4; }
if(Q.ch_res==="rozado"){ Q.estado_intel=(Q.estado_intel||0)+8; Q.expediente=(Q.expediente||0)+6; Q.f_cerco+=8; }
if(Q.ch_res==="roto"){ Q.estado_intel=(Q.estado_intel||0)+20; Q.expediente=(Q.expediente||0)+14; Q.f_cerco+=22; Q.paranoia=(Q.paranoia||8)+12; Q.f_moral-=8;
  if(Q.ch_p2==="suben"){ Q.camp_visto=1; Q.f_cerco+=10; } if(Q.ch_p2==="propio"){ Q.f_hombres-=1; Q.memorial=(Q.memorial||0)+2; } }
if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;} if(Q.f_moral<0){Q.f_moral=0;} if(Q.f_hombres<0){Q.f_hombres=0;}
!}

= Un año después

[? if ch_res = "aguanta" : It holds. For a year and more, things simply appear — a crate of clean G-3s with the numbers gone, papers good enough to move a wounded compañero through two states, penicillin in quantity, once an entire field radio. And twice, at moments the state could not possibly have arranged for, the army in Guerrero has to give up units because something enormous is happening in Monterrey. The synthesis is real. It works. You will not fully appreciate what it was worth until it is gone. ?][? if ch_res = "rozado" : It works, and it is seen working. Somewhere in a building on Circular de Morelia a file is opened with your camp in it — not the location, not yet, but the shape of you: the frequency of the deliveries, a description of a courier, the fact that the sierra de Atoyac is receiving weapons that were bought in Jalisco. Nothing happens this year. Files do not need to be acted on to be dangerous; they need only to be complete, and this one is filling. ?][? if ch_res = "roto" : They take a safe house in Guadalajara on an unremarkable Thursday, and after that it is only a question of how long the people in it hold out, which turns out to be between four hours and three days.[? if ch_p2 = "suben" : What comes out of it is worst case: two of the people who came up to the sierra to meet you can describe the walk in. The camp is on a map in Mexico City by the end of the month. ?][? if ch_p2 = "propio" : What comes out of it includes your own compañero, who was living down there as the link and who is now a name on a list of the disappeared, and who knew a great deal. ?][? if ch_p2 = "ciego" : What saves you is the protocol: the courier genuinely did not know anything, and what the state gets is a dead drop behind a shop in Atoyac and a physical description of a woman who could be anyone. It is bad. It is not fatal, and it is not fatal because of a decision you made on one night a year ago about how the thing would physically work. ?] The city's war and the sierra's war are one war. That was true when it was an advantage, and it is still true now. ?]

- @root: Continuar.
